          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Probability of HH "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{1}{4} = 0.25   or   25\\%."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.323,
            0.399,
            0.346
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Think and Reflect"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.359,
            0.785,
            0.38
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Can you calculate the probability of getting one head and one tail?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.374,
            0.422,
            0.624,
            0.451
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Exercise Set 7.4"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.474,
            0.886,
            0.534
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. There are two fruit baskets A and B. Basket A has one apple and two oranges. Basket B has one banana and one mango. You randomly pick one fruit from each basket."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.179,
            0.537,
            0.838,
            0.559
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) Draw a tree diagram showing all possible pairs of fruits."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.562,
            0.471,
            0.583
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) List the sample space."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.586,
            0.885,
            0.627
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) What is the probability of picking one apple and one banana?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.631,
            0.886,
            0.69
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Let us say that you have a box containing 3 red pens, 4 black pens and 2 green pens. You pick a pen (without looking) from the box and put it back. Then your friend does the same."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.179,
            0.694,
            0.885,
            0.736
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) What are the possible outcomes of the pen colours? Can you draw a tree diagram representing the possible outcomes?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.739,
            0.885,
            0.782
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) Can you use the tree diagram to guess the probability that both you and your friend pick pens of the same colour?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
